SCOPE

The MIT terms above cover the software in this repository: the agent
(`glee_agent/`), its tests (`tests/`), the tooling (`tools/`), and the analysis
scripts (`paper/analysis/`).

They do NOT cover the paper itself. "Below the Noise Floor: A Deterministic
GLEE Agent and the Measurement Problem It Exposed" -- its PDF, its LaTeX
sources (`paper/_head.tex`, `paper/_body.tex`, `paper/_tail.tex`,
`paper/refs.bib`, `paper/fig_noise.tex`), and the change register
(`paper/change-register.html`) -- remains Copyright (c) 2026 Yosef Zoabi, all
rights reserved. It is included here so readers of the paper can audit the work
behind it. Quote it as you would any paper, under normal academic citation.

`paper/neurips_2026.sty` is the official NeurIPS 2026 style file, redistributed
unmodified under its own terms, and is not covered by either of the above.
